# Hub and dialogs rep: F1 help, back, Esc quit prompt, focus quit, back to stay, keep playing, Tab Game Setup.
# Key presses sit on the bed beat grid inside the take: frame = round(26.25 * beat), held 5 frames.
# The edit places take beat 0 on a bar line of the Metropolis Zone bed (105 frames per bar).
setup=hub
width=320
preroll=90
realtime-ms=8
frames=630
26 F1   # beat 1
131 ESC   # beat 5
236 ESC   # beat 9
289 DOWN   # beat 11
341 UP   # beat 13
394 ENTER   # beat 15
446 TAB   # beat 17
499 DOWN   # beat 19
525 DOWN   # beat 20
604 ESC   # beat 23
